          %p
            %em Beilinson’s conjectures
            (
            %a{:href => "#Beilinson85"}> Beilinson 85
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conjecture"} conjecture
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/arithmetic+varieties"} arithmetic varieties
            over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/number+fields"} number fields
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                that the realification of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Beilinson+regulator"} Beilinson regulator
                exhibits an
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphism
                between the relevant
                = succeed "/" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+K-theory"} algebraic K-theory
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/motivic+cohomology"} motivic cohomology
                groups and
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Deligne+cohomology"} Deligne cohomology
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+differential+cohomology"}> ordinary differential cohomology
                ) groups;
              %p
                (recalled e.g. as
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#Schneider88"} Schneider 88, p. 30
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#BrylinskiZucker91"} Brylinski-Zucker 91, conjecture 5.20
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#DeningerScholl"} Deninger-Scholl (3.1.1)
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a{:href => "#Nekovar"} Nekovar (6.1 (1))
            %li
              %p
                induced by this that
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+values+of+L-functions"} special values
                of the (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hasse-Weil+L-function"}> Hasse-Weil
                \-type)
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-function"} L-function
                are proportional to the
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Beilinson+regulator"} Beilinson regulator
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/class+number+formula"} class number formula
                and the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Birch+and+Swinnerton-Dyer+conjecture"} Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture
              %p
                (recalled e.g. as
                %a{:href => "#Schneider88"} Schneider 88, p. 31
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#BrylinskiZucker91"} Brylinski-Zucker 91, conjecture 5.21
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#DeningerScholl"} Deninger-Scholl (3.1.2)
                = succeed "))." do
                  %a{:href => "#Nekovar"} Nekovar (6.1 (2))
          %p
            The Beilinson conjecture for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+values+of+L-functions"} special values of L-functions
            follows the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Birch+and+Swinnerton-Dyer+conjecture"} Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture
            and
            = succeed "\u2018s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Deligne"} Pierre Deligne
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-function"} L-function
            %li
